## Mentorship Program

### Program Structure

| Type | Description | Duration |
|------|-------------|----------|
| **Formal Mentoring** | Cross-functional pairing | 6 months |
| Matching: January, July | | |
| Commitment: 2 hours/month | | |
| **Peer Mentoring** | Same-level support | Ongoing |
| Informal, self-directed | | |
| **Executive Mentoring** | High-potential to exec | 12 months |
| Participants: 12/year | | |

### Mentor Qualifications
- IC4+ or M2+ level
- 1+ year at MedSync
- Strong performance rating
- Commitment to 2 hours/month

### Mentee Expectations
- Come prepared to each session
- Own your development goals
- Apply learnings and share progress
- Provide feedback on program

