## Learning Budget Usage

### $3,000 Annual Budget

**Approved Uses**:
- Online courses and certifications
- Books and publications
- Conference registration
- Professional memberships
- External workshops and training

**Not Covered**:
- Travel (separate budget)
- Degree programs (tuition reimbursement program)
- Personal development unrelated to role

### Approval Process

| Amount | Approval Required |
|--------|------------------|
| Under $500 | Self-service |
| $500 - $1,500 | Manager approval |
| $1,500 - $3,000 | Director approval |
| Over $3,000 | VP approval + tuition program |

